{"skill":{"slug":"gmail","displayName":"gmail"},"version":{"version":"1.2.5","createdAt":1790937348448,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":51508,"sha256":"b86170b1f53513eb2801a1b6fb2fcce357ee69579f96cc9dea5543505cc99731","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2143,"sha256":"770914f30b5380e238cc32e86b2c68f21183bc7ef172b7d7972f379820caf36a","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790937963855,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"9eb6fa6f3eae3c1bd1baf0dc6f17eadde8bc11de55156cdbdc05d62a836cc419","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/9eb6fa6f3eae3c1bd1baf0dc6f17eadde8bc11de55156cdbdc05d62a836cc419","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790937713710},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":4,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1790937963855},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This Gmail skill has sensitive email and automation capabilities, but the artifacts disclose them clearly and constrain them to user-approved Maton/Gmail workflows.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill requires network access, OAuth, and access to Gmail data; this is proportionate for Gmail integration. It also documents a raw API-key fallback only for environments where the CLI cannot be installed, with clear handling cautions.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Installation uses pinned Maton CLI and SDK versions via npm, Homebrew, or pip. This is normal for the integration, though users should install only from the documented Maton sources and upgrade deliberately.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The instructions repeatedly default to read/list operations, require explicit approval for connection creation, writes, deletes, functions, triggers, destinations, and local event execution, and treat third-party/API content as untrusted data.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"OAuth credentials, connections, hosted functions, triggers, destinations, and event-watch checkpoints can persist beyond a single task, but the skill discloses this and requires user confirmation, least-privilege scoping, and cleanup or deletion when no longer needed.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is Gmail API access through Maton, and the documented capabilities match that purpose: listing and reading mail, sending or drafting messages, managing labels/threads, creating Gmail connections, and optionally using Maton functions/triggers for user-approved automation.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install this only if you intend to let Maton access the selected Gmail account. Before approving writes, sending mail, creating automations, or adding trigger destinations, verify the exact account, recipient or URL, data fields, persistence, and cleanup plan. Prefer OAuth/CLI auth over raw API keys and avoid third-party destinations unless you explicitly trust the host and understand what mailbox data will flow there.","findings":"[SDI-2] expected: The Linear trigger reference is present in a shared platform event catalogue, but SKILL.md and the reference file both state that non-Gmail trigger files do not widen this Gmail skill and should be used only when the user has connected that source and asks for it by name; this downgrades the concern to disclosed, constrained reference material rather than operative Gmail-skill capability.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790937963855}}}}}